  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Pip. Pip is a puppy. Ben is a boy. Ben is Pip's friend. Ben has a toy car. The toy car is red. This red toy car is broken. Ben is very sad. Pip is sad too. My red car is broken. My good toy car is broken.",
      "Ben says, \"We fix car?\" Pip says, \"Yes. We fix car.\" Ben looks for a piece. Pip looks for a piece. Ben puts a small piece on. Pip helps Ben. Pip puts a small piece on. They work together. This is teamwork. Teamwork is good. They fix the red car.",
      "The red car is good. The red toy car is good now. Ben is happy. Pip is happy. They play with the red car. Ben and Pip play. This is fun. My friend is good. This good teamwork is fun. Teamwork is very good."
    ],
